{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14103160","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14103160","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1410316001:1":{"text":"エイン様。","source_cn":"奎茵冕下。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7D541E4A8FF5843D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1410316002:1":{"text":"何かあったのですか、インドラ？表情に陰りが見えますよ。","source_cn":"因度厄，竟能从你脸上看见些许情绪，出什么事了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x604FD8027A621ED6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1410316003:1":{"text":"王都から逃げ出した召使いが厄化したため排除しましたが、それを地表の者に目撃されてしまいました。","source_cn":"从萨洛克兰逃跑的仆从出现孽化，随后被清除。这一过程被这...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x40FFC9F14B74BD66","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1410316004:1":{"text":"しかし、厄化した者に迅速に対処できたのも、彼らの助力のおかげです。","source_cn":"幸得他们出手相助，孽化者已经遭到制裁，没有引发更大的风波。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD1AB4EDC67F0FC85","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1410316005:0":{"text":"ご報告ありがとうございます。詳しいことは彼らに直接聞きますので、あなたはもう下がっていいですよ。","source_cn":"很好，感谢你简明扼要的汇报。更具体情况我会直接向这些贵...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x396414EB7A381DC2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_tit